# jebi

## Introduction

STM32G474 로봇 라이브러리

## Installation

```bash
cd jebi_driver
git clone --branch 5.9.0 --depth 1 https://github.com/ARM-software/CMSIS_5.git
git clone --branch v1.2.5 --depth 1 https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/cmsis-device-g4.git
git clone --branch v1.2.5 --depth 1 https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/stm32g4xx-hal-driver.git
```